  "HUD_ITEMOBTAIN_TEXT_006": "[RUBY:BASE ]鉱石[RUBY:BEGIN ]こうせき[RUBY:END ]で[RUBY:BASE ]保存処理[RUBY:BEGIN ]ほぞんしょり[RUBY:END ]された[RUBY:BASE ]魔女[RUBY:BEGIN ]まじょ[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]調合素材[RUBY:BEGIN ]ちょうごうそざい[RUBY:END ]。\r\nことあるごとに[RUBY:BASE ]叫[RUBY:BEGIN ]さけ[RUBY:END ]び[RUBY:BASE ]声[RUBY:BEGIN ]ごえ[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]上[RUBY:BEGIN ]あ[RUBY:END ]げるため、\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]荷物[RUBY:BEGIN ]にもつ[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]奥深[RUBY:BEGIN ]おくふか[RUBY:END ]くにしまっておこう。",
