  "HUD_INTERACT_TEXT_0214_CER": "[RUBY:BASE ]人[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひと[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]手配書[RUBY:BEGIN ]てはいしょ[RUBY:END ]をこんなところに[RUBY:BASE ]撒[RUBY:BEGIN ]ま[RUBY:END ]くなんて！\r\nもっと[RUBY:BASE ]丁寧[RUBY:BEGIN ]ていねい[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]扱[RUBY:BEGIN ]あつか[RUBY:END ]ってほしいものね！",
  "HUD_INTERACT_TEXT_0106_CER": "[RUBY:BASE ]大[RUBY:BEGIN ]おお[RUBY:END ]きな[RUBY:BASE ]湖[RUBY:BEGIN ]みずうみ[RUBY:END ]ね……！\r\nん、あそこ……[RUBY:BASE ]何[RUBY:BEGIN ]なに[RUBY:END ]かが[RUBY:BASE ]詰[RUBY:BEGIN ]つ[RUBY:END ]まってる……？",
