  "HUD_INTERACT_TEXT_0001_CER": "[RUBY:BASE ]町[RUBY:BEGIN ]まち[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]通[RUBY:BEGIN ]つう[RUBY:END ]じる[RUBY:BASE ]門[RUBY:BEGIN ]もん[RUBY:END ]ね。\r\n……[RUBY:BASE ]町[RUBY:BEGIN ]まち[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]行[RUBY:BEGIN ]い[RUBY:END ]こうなんて、[RUBY:BASE ]思[RUBY:BEGIN ]おも[RUBY:END ]わないけど",
  "HUD_PREVENT_TEXT_0002_CER": "ダメダメ、[RUBY:BASE ]今[RUBY:BEGIN ]いま[RUBY:END ]はおつかいに[RUBY:BASE ]集中[RUBY:BEGIN ]しゅうちゅう[RUBY:END ]しなきゃ。\r\nまた[RUBY:BASE ]雷[RUBY:BEGIN ]かみなり[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]落[RUBY:BEGIN ]お[RUBY:END ]とされちゃうわ！",
