  "HUD_INTERACT_TEXT_0219_CER": "とんでもない[RUBY:BASE ]長[RUBY:BEGIN ]なが[RUBY:END ]さの[RUBY:BASE ]滑[RUBY:BEGIN ]すべ[RUBY:END ]り[RUBY:BASE ]台[RUBY:BEGIN ]だい[RUBY:END ]だったわね……。\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]思[RUBY:BEGIN ]おも[RUBY:END ]い[RUBY:BASE ]出[RUBY:BEGIN ]だ[RUBY:END ]すだけでお[RUBY:BASE ]尻[RUBY:BEGIN ]しり[RUBY:END ]が[RUBY:BASE ]熱[RUBY:BEGIN ]あつ[RUBY:END ]くなるわ……",
